*/CLAUDE.md
**/*/CLAUDE.md

# custom prompts (user-specific)
scripts/prompts-custom/

# Content Brain — private knowledge store (entries, sources, proposals, index)
# Root-anchored so it does NOT match scripts/brain/ (the code)
/brain/
